blank.","ar":"يعطيك الكتاب خطّة فيها أربع فراغات. تحت غطاء المحرّك، هناك فراغ. هناك فراغ."},"id":"L005"},{"actor":"rana","start":30.16,"text":{"en":"There is some blank. There are blank filters.","ar":"هناك بعض الفراغ. هناك فراغ فلاتر."},"id":"L006"},{"actor":"tarek","start":33.966,"text":{"en":"Here is one way to fill it. Under the bonnet, there is an engine. There are a battery and a radiator.","ar":"هذه طريقة لتعبئتها. تحت غطاء المحرّك، هناك محرّك. هناك بطارية وراديتير."},"id":"L007"},{"actor":"tarek","start":42.404,"text":{"en":"There is some oil. There are two filters.","ar":"هناك بعض الزيت. هناك فلتران."},"id":"L008"},{"actor":"rana","start":47.002,"text":{"en":"Now look at what each sentence is doing.","ar":"الآن انظر إلى ما يفعله كلّ جملة."},"id":"L009"},{"actor":"rana","start":50.088,"text":{"en":"The first sentence names the one big thing: there is an engine.","ar":"الجملة الأولى تسمّي الشيء الكبير الواحد: هناك محرّك."},"id":"L010"},{"actor":"rana","start":54.35,"text":{"en":"One engine, so is it there is or there are?","ar":"محرّك واحد، فهل نقول there is أم there are؟"},"subHold":8.77,"id":"L011"},{"actor":"rana","start":63.12,"text":{"en":"There is. One thing takes there is.","ar":"There is. الشيء الواحد يأخذ there is."},"id":"L012"},{"actor":"rana","start":66.662,"text":{"en":"The second sentence names two things together, so it changes.","ar":"الجملة الثانية تسمّي شيئين معاً، فتتغيّر."},"id":"L013"},{"actor":"rana","start":71.26,"text":{"en":"A battery and a radiator: which one now?","ar":"بطارية وراديتير: أيّهما الآن؟"},"subHold":8.568,"id":"L014"},{"actor":"rana","start":79.828,"text":{"en":"There are. Two things take there are.","ar":"There are. الشيئان يأخذان there are."},"id":"L015"},{"actor":"rana","start":83.082,"text":{"en":"Oil or filters: which one needs there is?","ar":"الزيت أم الفلاتر: أيّهما يحتاج there is؟"},"subHold":8.748,"id":"L016"},{"actor":"rana","start":91.83,"text":{"en":"Oil. Oil is uncountable, so there is some oil.","ar":"الزيت. الزيت غير معدود، فنقول there is some oil."},"id":"L017"},{"actor":"rana","start":96.212,"text":{"en":"And the last sentence counts them: there are two filters.","ar":"والجملة الأخيرة تعدّها: هناك فلتران."},"id":"L018"},{"actor":"tarek","start":100.234,"text":{"en":"That is fifty-four words, with two uncountable nouns and two counted ones.","ar":"هذه أربع وخمسون كلمة، فيها اسمان غير معدودين واثنان معدودان."},"id":"L019"},{"actor":"rana","start":106.176,"text":{"en":"Now it is your turn.","ar":"الآن دورك."},"id":"L020"},{"actor":"rana","start":108.398,"text":{"en":"Pause the video, and write your own fifty to seventy words.","ar":"أوقف الفيديو، واكتب من خمسين إلى سبعين كلمة من عندك."},"id":"L021"},{"actor":"rana","start":112.876,"text":{"en":"Check before you finish. Did you use there is and there are? Did you use some, any, much, or many?","ar":"تحقّق قبل أن تنتهي. هل استخدمت there is و there are؟ هل استخدمت some أو any أو much أو many؟"},"id":"L022"},{"actor":"rana","start":120.714,"text":{"en":"Is it fifty to seventy words? Are the capitals and full stops right?","ar":"هل هي من خمسين إلى سبعين كلمة؟ هل الحروف الكبيرة والنقاط صحيحة؟"},"id":"L023"},{"actor":"rana","start":126.272,"text":{"en":"The book has two more tasks: a note about a leak, and a stock list for your own bay.","ar":"في الكتاب مهمّتان أخريان: مذكّرة عن تسريب، وقائمة مخزون لموقعك."},"id":"L024"}],"subtitles":{"enabled":true,"langs":"en,ar","show":null,"lang":{}},"badgePlacement":{"x":"0.016","y":"0.016","width":"0.205"},"audio":{"master":"audio.m4a","lines":[{"key":"8de7bf4a5083966f","bytes":35424,"sha":"c703d4edde5446a8","address":"lines/8de7bf4a5083966f.mp3"},{"key":"71a449c6868797ab","bytes":40608,"sha":"c55d67a5df7ca506","address":"lines/71a449c6868797ab.mp3"},{"key":"926c37011943d4d7","bytes":25488,"sha":"76cf535c909ecfb5","address":"lines/926c37011943d4d7.mp3"},{"key":"f68291495a476bb5","bytes":26496,"sha":"cbc5f43b1d98f035","address":"lines/f68291495a476bb5.mp3"},{"key":"a4f4058e1b0f80da","b